// Runtime detection is intentionally opt-in. Import this file only when one
// firmware image must run on multiple M5Stack boards. Static board profiles do
// not import it and therefore retain no detector code or probe state.
import "./detect_logic.ab"

// Hardware adapters remain target-specific so a detector for another SoC can
// never be selected accidentally. Import detect_esp32s3.ab or
// detect_esp32c6.ab / detect_esp32c5.ab alongside this surface when needed.
// detect_esp32c3.ab additionally requires quiesced exclusive GPIO20 ownership.
// detect_esp32p4.ab samples caller-prepared inputs without writes;
// detect_owned_esp32p4.ab configures/restores GPIO32/0 under exclusive ownership.
// Its negative errors must be handled, especially -4 (restoration incomplete).
// detect_esp32.ab supplies classic package/GPIO/touch/charge-decay detection as
// an owned begin/poll/cancel session; a result is valid only after restoration.
